    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acbf04b280b3561996129312",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在接力赛作为最后一棒大逆转的时候也超～这么想的！\n『现在的我，是不是很像漫画？』这样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a00feaed82d97cd9e6d42e5d731bdaa8db6158d70883fb0bfbe8d27c047328",
