    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11de96c61b5c36b4c864a227",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那之后神业也开始来训练员室玩了。\n顺便一提，她带来的漫画，也有几十本收纳在了书架上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a330abe847a8d8c43dd1d0da1be406e9bb57341d3765df784578793ca482940c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
