      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――那个！训练员！比赛是很厉害的！\n吸引观众，让人惊讶，让人感动！那是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0b65898535bfb1667a7d84f44826414a6b47f72de5c7916e65d3d0c0786416",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
