    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc25327fb4255abd6b5449b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能做到像漫画一样的事！让大家狂热，极其华丽，\n有趣又热血，能用这双腿创造出来，像传说级漫画一样的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2088642e7edd1a30148463b087a3ce07201391d8b7056776904b251b63ad36d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
