      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从她的气势中，我理解了她至今为止那多彩而充满个性的奔跑\n的根源。也就是说她是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b46a4a2d0abca0b0cd3dc91ff673f58fd41472655ee7f5a2db75a30cb56c5e55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
