      "uid": "zhcn:26659818c25bce22643f2d2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有理由拒绝神业的邀请。\n于是两天后，我前往赛道。在那里――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df492f2119dc285521c04edd7e16c738b0608bfdde822220c7a6e0f67cb9ea1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
