      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是树木开始染上色彩的季节。\n那是一个秋高气爽连绵不断的某日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35e273932421a35c3391649333e4ec41298cd71757577d584612d6328d37234",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
