      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『午休开始啦！』『炒面面包DX，今天只进了10个！』\n『好少！？必须快点去！！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "46baf023d658b67fdd8045128f03aba331dc28508c39afe39edbb7b879aa6648",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
